Note on the name and the licence choice

"MIT" was chosen because it is the least restrictive common option and this
project is an academic deliverable that cites third-party benchmarks rather
than embedding them. No CIS Benchmark, Microsoft Security Baseline or NIST
publication text is redistributed here: the baseline pack references those
standards by name and URL, which is a citation, not a reproduction. Confirm
the licence with the project author and the awarding institution before any
public distribution.
